@'
# Terraform state and generated files
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# Local Terraform variables
**/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars.json

# Lambda deployment packages
**/*.zip
'@ | Set-Content .gitignore -Encoding utf8